      "bytes": 9790767,
      "license": "MIT code (yakhyo/gaze-estimation, L2CS-Net derived).",
      "license_caveat": "RESEARCH USE ONLY. These weights are trained on Gaze360 (Kellnhofer et al., ICCV 2019), whose dataset licence permits non-commercial research use only. Shipping this engine in a commercial vehicle image requires re-training on a commercially licensed gaze corpus. Product must accept this before the gaze capability leaves the lab; until then the wrapper must report source=UNAVAILABLE in a production build.",
